Shared code

  Some files are shared with a Nintendo 3DS port of the same code base and adapted from it: the
  fast register decode and pipeline info reuse (patches/aurora/0003, 0004), the display lists by
  reference (patches/aurora/0006, patches/dusklight/0014), the J3D matrix loads
  (patches/dusklight/0011, platform/vita/gfx_vgl/xf_fifo_block.hpp) and the CPU vertex stage
  (platform/vita/gfx_vgl/vertex.cpp). Both ports are by the same authors and under the same license.
  tests/fixtures/baseline/ holds frozen earlier versions of this port's own files.

Game data and firmware

  This repository contains no game data: no disc image, no file extracted from a disc, no textures,
  models, audio, fonts or text from the game, no Nintendo or Sony software, no firmware module and
  no shader compiler. Every user supplies their own copy of the game and extracts libshacccg.suprx on
  their own console. The VPK built from this repository contains the compiled game code from the
  decompilation above and no game assets. The CC0 declaration of Dusklight does not grant any right
  in Nintendo's game, characters or trademarks.
